@title  PCSE00023 - NO INPUT: sit on the title screen and let the demo fight run
@game   PCSE00023
@shot-every 100000

# The NEGATIVE CONTROL for every input-driven recipe on this title: whatever reaches the
# screen here is what the title chose to show, with nothing this project pressed.
#
0: @todo no @assert yet - judged by its shots.

# The user's own repro for the stray flat shapes, in their words: "when you stay at main
# screen and don't press anything" and watch the demo fight. So this recipe presses NOTHING -
# the logos play out, the title screen sits, and the attract-mode demo fight starts on its own.
# `mk-explore1.recipe` cannot serve this: it taps cross fifteen times through the logo stretch
# and so walks into a different screen entirely.

0: @section boot
2400: @section attract
6000: @note no input at any point - whatever is on screen is what the title chose to show
